  <Title type="string">Towards how to hang a painting upside down on purpose</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Ingrid Vasquez talks about the long argument with the colour blue. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</synopsis>
